<speak version="1.0" xml:lang="en-US" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis">
  <voice name="en-US-JennyNeural">
    <prosody rate="-8%" pitch="+2%">
      Pippa sees a little frog.<break time="350ms"/>It sits and sits upon a log.<break time="350ms"/>&quot;Come play with me,&quot; says Pippa Pig.<break time="350ms"/>The frog says nothing. That is big.
